WEBVTT

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:32.768
I loved to compete.

00:04:33.644 --> 00:04:35.980
At everything, not just in sports, either.

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:39.692
This one time my teacher
in elementary school, he said,

00:04:39.692 --> 00:04:43.738
"I want to know who can learn
the helping verb song the fastest.

00:04:43.738 --> 00:04:48.242
(Sings)

00:04:48.242 --> 00:04:49.243
(Laughter)

00:04:49.285 --> 00:04:50.536
I love to compete.

00:04:50.578 --> 00:04:54.040
I was that kid. I was that kid.

00:04:54.081 --> 00:04:57.001
(Applause)

00:04:57.918 --> 00:05:00.963
But what I loved so much
was that I was allowed to be me.